config TILT_SIM
  bool "Simulate tilt sensor readings"
  default y
  help
    Feeds synthetic X/Y/Z tilt values (slow drift plus periodic shake
    bursts) into device_status_set_tilt(), standing in for a real
    accelerometer driver so the Tilt screen can be exercised without
    hardware. Disable once a real tilt sensor driver is wired in.
